                        "form": "и́згородях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "53728aba-ed79-3e93-ae13-60183c2dcbf5",
                        "entry_id": "c9bfcce6-e037-3e4b-9067-0be2b51d31a7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "лёгкий забор, ограда (обычно из вбитых в землю кольев с поперечно укреплёнными жердями)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7b7152b3-51d4-480e-83b4-0ba7371c9a30",
                                "sense_id": "53728aba-ed79-3e93-ae13-60183c2dcbf5",
                                "text": "Идя по прямому направлению, он скоро подошёл к изгороди, сложенной из средней толщины кольев, заострённых вверху."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "db5646be-6fa7-476d-a6e2-8075cd34ce4e",
                                "sense_id": "53728aba-ed79-3e93-ae13-60183c2dcbf5",
                                "text": "Был только обширный дом, окружённый двором с изгородью из толстых дубовых кольев."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3e1e7bee-58c2-4d53-bee8-e271e146a0a3",
                                "sense_id": "53728aba-ed79-3e93-ae13-60183c2dcbf5",
                                "text": "Через калитку в каменной изгороди Щепкин прошел через аллею на круглый двор."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b425ef1e-3e84-4ef1-a0dd-91cf6db50065",
                        "source_entry_id": "c9bfcce6-e037-3e4b-9067-0be2b51d31a7",
                        "source_sense_id": "53728aba-ed79-3e93-ae13-60183c2dcbf5",
                        "target_lang_word": "fence",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fence",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "63332de0-6fd4-3a86-a4b9-3e6ef98f595d",
                                        "entry_id": "64742e8f-95cb-343e-8b62-634c0ae8768b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A thin artificial barrier that separates two pieces of land or forms a perimeter enclosing the lands of a house, building, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b2a0d18-da4b-4ab1-a94d-ab64b9683727",
                                                "sense_id": "63332de0-6fd4-3a86-a4b9-3e6ef98f595d",
                                                "text": "There was a weak place in the fence separating the two inclosures"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88571ac7-5a5f-4911-9a84-b4c01d6c452a",
                                                "sense_id": "63332de0-6fd4-3a86-a4b9-3e6ef98f595d",
                                                "text": "From the ground, Colombo’s port does not look like much. Those entering it are greeted by wire fences, walls dating back to colonial times and security posts. For mariners leaving the port after lonely nights on the high seas, the delights of the B52 Night Club and Stallion Pub lie a stumble away."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2da5a28c-a3f8-33bb-956f-12272ba7157c",
                                        "entry_id": "64742e8f-95cb-343e-8b62-634c0ae8768b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who hides or buys and sells stolen goods, a criminal middleman for transactions of stolen goods."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "informal",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dcd251e1-b3ea-4cf7-aa55-0684f3ecd2bd",
                                                "sense_id": "2da5a28c-a3f8-33bb-956f-12272ba7157c",
                                                "text": "The Bat—they called him the Bat.[…]. He'd never been in stir, the bulls had never mugged him, he didn't run with a mob, he played a lone hand, and fenced his stuff so that even the fence couldn't swear he knew his face."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80f347da-8075-4a6b-9cc0-2bc3b596b203",
                                                "sense_id": "2da5a28c-a3f8-33bb-956f-12272ba7157c",
                                                "text": "The Finn was a fence, a trafficker in stolen goods, primarily in software. In the course of this business, he sometimes came into contact with other fences, some of whom dealt in the more traditional articles of the trade."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "859ef4b5-8055-329f-8589-aa7c3777fbcb",
                                        "entry_id": "64742e8f-95cb-343e-8b62-634c0ae8768b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The place whence such a middleman operates."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "60233f49-6fdd-3df7-be1e-06ed11641181",
                                        "entry_id": "64742e8f-95cb-343e-8b62-634c0ae8768b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Skill in oral debate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2753033c-fe1d-3823-9193-5d2a91eec60d",
                                        "entry_id": "64742e8f-95cb-343e-8b62-634c0ae8768b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The art or practice of fencing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "249994a9-0bc0-47d9-8c67-9481d0ae0949",
                                                "sense_id": "2753033c-fe1d-3823-9193-5d2a91eec60d",
                                                "text": "I bruised my shin th' other day with playing at sword and dagger with a master of fence"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f776c062-fbed-320f-87c0-31534789c135",
                                        "entry_id": "64742e8f-95cb-343e-8b62-634c0ae8768b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A guard or guide on machinery."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "986ce06d-4df4-346f-bca5-853160a3e718",
                                        "entry_id": "64742e8f-95cb-343e-8b62-634c0ae8768b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A barrier, for example an emotional barrier."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1410265b-5c0c-412e-b1e3-92f8deb2ef7d",
                                                "sense_id": "986ce06d-4df4-346f-bca5-853160a3e718",
                                                "text": "I was in your arms\nThinking I belonged there\nI figured it made sense\nBuilding me a fence"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d92bb65d-121e-36c7-a6fd-fe1b6f2e55ab",
                                        "entry_id": "64742e8f-95cb-343e-8b62-634c0ae8768b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A memory barrier."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "322684fd-7cdc-38cb-be60-d61baaba0800",
                                        "entry_id": "64742e8f-95cb-343e-8b62-634c0ae8768b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The boundary."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "fence",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6c224640-97f9-3274-95d9-a52893820ca4",
                                        "entry_id": "444df966-582c-310f-a7c1-3f9d180f12f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To enclose, contain or separate by building fence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a13549a2-0805-4bf5-a484-57d99cbf8057",
                                                "sense_id": "6c224640-97f9-3274-95d9-a52893820ca4",
                                                "text": "[…] pray you, if you know,\nWhere in the purlieus of this forest stands\nA sheep-cote fenc’d about with olive trees?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "53029d8f-3a05-4e66-b1f1-3d33160127ad",
                                                "sense_id": "6c224640-97f9-3274-95d9-a52893820ca4",
                                                "text": "[…] O thou wall,\nThat girdlest in those wolves, dive in the earth,\nAnd fence not Athens."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c576b99-5af9-4646-afbc-6b81f43a5bad",
                                                "sense_id": "6c224640-97f9-3274-95d9-a52893820ca4",
                                                "text": "Here are twenty acres of land, and it is all you can properly farm, unless you have more help than yourself. Now fence and cultivate it, and you can make an abundant living."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e2a37488-be1b-3b5a-bfd0-71427d703a54",
                                        "entry_id": "444df966-582c-310f-a7c1-3f9d180f12f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To defend or guard."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e85d8146-5354-4b25-a7db-537dd40b64e6",
                                                "sense_id": "e2a37488-be1b-3b5a-bfd0-71427d703a54",
                                                "text": "Cosin, our hands I hope shall fence our heads,\nAnd strike off his that makes you threaten vs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "673957e7-1ef5-4a5a-a418-e79d188e7d87",
                                                "sense_id": "e2a37488-be1b-3b5a-bfd0-71427d703a54",
                                                "text": "[…] I have learn’t\nTo fence my ear against thy sorceries."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc311272-7f94-3caa-b48c-27c564211ff9",
                                        "entry_id": "444df966-582c-310f-a7c1-3f9d180f12f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To engage in the selling or buying of stolen goods."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4588df7d-5584-4c30-8547-beaac45f0f5c",
                                                "sense_id": "dc311272-7f94-3caa-b48c-27c564211ff9",
                                                "text": "The Bat—they called him the Bat.[…]. He'd never been in stir, the bulls had never mugged him, he didn't run with a mob, he played a lone hand, and fenced his stuff so that even the fence couldn't swear he knew his face."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f2aa2dd1-6d83-3593-838f-f0b430ce9921",
                                        "entry_id": "444df966-582c-310f-a7c1-3f9d180f12f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To engage in the sport of fencing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ab21c1b-9062-43db-a930-7c42711d0dee",
                                                "sense_id": "f2aa2dd1-6d83-3593-838f-f0b430ce9921",
                                                "text": "Challenges are flying right and left between these bully-swordsmen, these spadassinicides, and poor devils of the robe who have never learnt to fence with anything but a quill."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6c1f8d36-5700-3f93-9d1e-1a46c6cd8e48",
                                        "entry_id": "444df966-582c-310f-a7c1-3f9d180f12f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To jump over a fence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bfd3cd55-af93-391b-830e-ae6f46b3aa38",
                                        "entry_id": "444df966-582c-310f-a7c1-3f9d180f12f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To conceal the truth by giving equivocal answers; to hedge; to be evasive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2e5143c-f36a-4610-b525-822c667f1d26",
                                                "sense_id": "bfd3cd55-af93-391b-830e-ae6f46b3aa38",
                                                "text": "A lady, sir, as you will find, / Keeps counsel, or she speaks her mind, / Means what she says and scorns to fence / And palter with feigned innocence."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2cbb2f8e-1b8c-4163-a54b-482b65b7b8c9",
                        "source_entry_id": "c9bfcce6-e037-3e4b-9067-0be2b51d31a7",
                        "source_sense_id": "53728aba-ed79-3e93-ae13-60183c2dcbf5",
                        "target_lang_word": "Zaun",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Zaun",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "78029836-b51b-355d-a0d2-e983239a4d6b",
                                        "entry_id": "29cc20ef-f186-3b9b-b5c8-6635dc7094f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "eine aus Drahtgeflecht oder aus (gekreuzten, parallel angeordneten oder dergleichen) Metall- oder Holzstäben bestehende Vorrichtung, die zumeist ein Grundstück, ein bestimmtes Areal oder dergleichen eingrenzt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "53143d3f-c2a1-48f7-a2ac-63f8873201ee",
                                                "sense_id": "78029836-b51b-355d-a0d2-e983239a4d6b",
                                                "text": "Viele Menschen frieden ihr Grundstück mit einem Zaun ein."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "097d9c51-1bb5-4bff-a435-f5f8ed20620f",
                                                "sense_id": "78029836-b51b-355d-a0d2-e983239a4d6b",
                                                "text": "„Es blieb nicht aus, daß wir dann vor dem Zaun standen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7899c95-739d-4eb5-acf0-7945a9906802",
                                                "sense_id": "78029836-b51b-355d-a0d2-e983239a4d6b",
                                                "text": "„Und die Kosaken sahen sich erstaunt nach Denissow um, als er sich mit einigen nach Hundegebell klingenden Lauten rasch abwandte, an den Zaun ging und sich gegen ihn lehnte.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b5cd9ed-610b-4801-af1b-e7080e31e951",
                                                "sense_id": "78029836-b51b-355d-a0d2-e983239a4d6b",
                                                "text": "„Eines Tages überraschte ihn der Vater, wie er mit der mühsam festgehaltenen Büchse, auf den Fußspitzen stehend, durch eine Schießscharte des Zaunes nach einem unfern aufgeblockten Hühnergeier zielte.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48eb6405-4bfa-4fe5-8c25-82b8ed4aac06",
                                                "sense_id": "78029836-b51b-355d-a0d2-e983239a4d6b",
                                                "text": "„Über einen Gartenzaun grünten Fliederbüsche, und nicht eine Latte des Zaunes war zerbrochen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
